      ],
      "en": "He spread it before me. It was written within and without; and lamentations, mourning, and woe were written in it.",
      "ko": "그가 그것을 내 앞에 펴시니 그 안팎에 글이 있는데 애가와 애곡과 재앙의 말이 기록되었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "b265ef419f23996adf15f15b17f554a206b0b5e72ff20f5c14ce422bd5213cd2",
